  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "New Technologies in China",
      "cn": "第 40 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "Ethan is a member of the science club.",
      "cn": "伊森是科学俱乐部的一名成员。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "He has great knowledge about new technologies in China.",
      "cn": "他非常了解中国的新技术。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "Shared bikes are becoming popular.",
      "cn": "共享单车正变得流行。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "They are bringing cycling back to people's lives and are making people more active.",
      "cn": "它们让骑行回到人们的生活中，并使人们更活跃。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "My wallet is no longer used.",
      "cn": "我的钱包不再被使用。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "I don't need to carry money anymore.",
      "cn": "我不再需要随身带钱。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "I can buy whatever I want with my mobile phone as long as there is the Internet.",
      "cn": "只要有互联网，我就可以用手机买任何我想要的东西。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "All I need to do is scan a store's QR code and pay.",
      "cn": "我需要做的只是扫描商店的二维码并付款。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "Almost everyone who sells things is using Alipay.",
      "cn": "几乎每个卖东西的人都在使用支付宝。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "I don't need to go out and spend a lot of time seeking things I want.",
      "cn": "我不需要出门花很多时间寻找想要的东西。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "I can buy different kinds of things just at home.",
      "cn": "我只在家里就可以买到各种各样的东西。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "What's more, I can buy them cheaply.",
      "cn": "而且，我可以便宜地买到它们。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "en": "I had an experience of travelling by Chinese high-speed railways from Beijing to Tianjin, more than 100 km away.",
      "cn": "我曾有一次乘坐中国高铁从北京到天津旅行的经历，两地相距 100 多公里。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "en": "The journey takes only half an hour.",
      "cn": "旅程只需半个小时。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
